  values ('ME', 'short_answer', 'How can an individual prevent the loss of biodiversity and exploitation of its resources? Give three examples. (3 marks)', 'An individual can help by: (1) not over-exploiting resources - never hunting or poaching, not buying products made from wild animals or plants, and harvesting firewood, medicinal plants, cordyceps or fish only in sustainable amounts with permits; (2) protecting habitats - planting native trees, preventing forest fires, not dumping waste or polluting rivers, and respecting national parks and community forests; (3) living sustainably and spreading awareness - reducing, reusing and recycling, saving water and energy, avoiding single-use plastics, not releasing invasive species or pets into the wild, and taking part in clean-up, plantation and awareness campaigns.', null, '[{"point": "Avoid over-exploitation: do not hunt/ poach, buy wildlife products, or over-collect medicinal plants, firewood, fish", "marks": 1}, {"point": "Protect habitats: plant native trees, avoid burning forests, littering and polluting rivers; support protected areas", "marks": 1}, {"point": "Sustainable lifestyle and awareness: reduce, reuse, recycle, save energy and water, avoid plastics, do not introduce invasive species, join conservation/ awareness activities", "marks": 1}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'general-subject-knowledge'),
    (select t.id from public.topics t where t.subject_id = (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'general-subject-knowledge') and t.slug = 'bio-science-general-subject-knowledge'), (select id from public.exam_papers where code = 'me-technical-2'), 'standard', 3,
